msgid "Tactical Game"
msgstr "Taktička igra"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.klines.appdata.xml:12
msgid "Kolor Lines is a simple but highly addictive one player game."
msgstr "Kolor Lines je jednostavna igra za jednog igrača koja lako može zaokupiti."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.klines.appdata.xml:15
msgid "The player has to move the colored balls around the game board, gathering them into the lines of the same color by five. Once the line is complete it is removed from the board, therefore freeing precious space. In the same time the new balls keep arriving by three after each move, filling up the game board."
msgstr "Igrač pomiče obojene kuglice po ploči i slaže ih u redove od pet kuglica iste boje. Dovršeni red uklanja se s ploče i tako oslobađa dragocjeni prostor. Istodobno se nakon svakog poteza pojavljuju tri nove kuglice koje popunjavaju ploču."